{"lang": "zh_CN", "eventid": "act52side", "eventName": "昨日海", "entryType": "ACTIVITY", "storyCode": "YW-6", "avgTag": "行动前", "storyName": "大人物", "storyInfo": "打捞港都中心城区当晚，瓦列里奥为德·托莱多求来了点亮海图的机会。另一边，审判庭开展针对奥卢斯的抓捕行动。", "storyList": [{"id": 0, "prop": "HEADER", "attributes": {"key": "title_test", "is_skippable": "true", "fit_mode": "BLACK_MASK"}}, {"id": 1, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 2, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 3, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 4, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 5, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 6, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "74_g6_gdsquare_n", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 7, "prop": "playMusic", "attributes": {"intro": "$path_intro", "key": "$path_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 8, "prop": "playsound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_crowdtalk_fear", "loop": "true", "channel": "a", "volume": 0.0}}, {"id": 9, "prop": "SoundVolume", "attributes": {"volume": 1.0, "channel": "a", "fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 10, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 11, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 12, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2274_1#1$1", "posfrom": "-50,0", "posto": "-50,0", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 13, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_178", "posfrom": "50,0", "posto": "50,0", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 14, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "嘿，那边的小伙子，来点海藻酒吗？", "name": "城镇居民A"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2274_1#1$1"}, {"id": 15, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 16, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 17, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我们必须要保持洁净，酒会使人堕落，它——", "name": "城镇居民B"}}, {"id": 18, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 19, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "什么日子办什么事儿嘛。估摸着也是为了庆祝港都中心城区升起，那边的惩戒军刚才都来光顾我的生意了。", "name": "城镇居民A"}}, {"id": 20, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 21, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_178", "posfrom": "50,0", "posto": "-10,0", "afrom": 1.0, "ato": 1.0, "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 22, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 23, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 24, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……好吧，我只喝一点点，要是醉昏了头，就看不清海图上的坐标了。", "name": "城镇居民B"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_178"}, {"id": 25, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 26, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 0.8}}, {"id": 27, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_drinkswllw", "volume": 1.0}}, {"id": 28, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 0.8}}, {"id": 29, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 30, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "到时候你还看什么坐标啊！再过两个小时，港都的中心城区就会直接在你眼前升起来！", "name": "城镇居民A"}}, {"id": 31, "prop": "StopSound", "attributes": {"channel": "a", "fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 32, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 33, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 34, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_gen_walk_n", "volume": 1.0}}, {"id": 35, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_460_1#1$1", "duration": 1.5}}, {"id": 36, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_462_1#1$1", "duration": 1.5}}, {"id": 37, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.8}}, {"id": 38, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 39, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "来看看，那位阿戈尔监事留在这儿的海图。他们说港都的坐标已经在上面了。", "name": "城镇居民C"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_460_1#1$1"}, {"id": 40, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 41, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "中心城区……你能想象那地方长什么样吗？真要是住在那里面，得是什么感受？", "name": "城镇居民D"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_462_1#1$1"}, {"id": 42, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 43, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "听说那里有些房子，就连砖缝都是用金粉勾的。那样的话，是不是一点都不会漏风？", "name": "城镇居民C"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_460_1#1$1"}, {"id": 44, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你能想象吗，不会被海风吹透的房子？", "name": "城镇居民C"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_460_1#1$1"}, {"id": 45, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 46, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……我是在草棚里长大的啊。", "name": "城镇居民D"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_462_1#1$1"}, {"id": 47, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我甚至都没想过有一天自己会看着与阿戈尔相连的海图，在上面找那些只有老一辈人提过的名字。", "name": "城镇居民D"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_462_1#1$1"}, {"id": 48, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 49, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "那都是伊比利亚曾经的城市啊……圣徒在上，居然真有那么多。", "name": "城镇居民C"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_460_1#1$1"}, {"id": 50, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "喏，你看，港都的坐标在那儿！它还是灰色的。", "name": "城镇居民C"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_460_1#1$1"}, {"id": 51, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 52, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "两个小时之后，它就要被点亮了吧？", "name": "城镇居民D"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_462_1#1$1"}, {"id": 53, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 54, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "船厂的工人们今夜一定会很忙，不知道哪个伊比利亚人能获此殊荣，亲手点亮一座静默了六十三年的宏伟都城。", "name": "城镇居民C"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_460_1#1$1"}, {"id": 55, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 56, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "大概是哪位深受圣徒阁下信任的大审判官吧。这个时间，他们应该已经在准备了。", "name": "城镇居民D"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_462_1#1$1"}, {"id": 57, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 58, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 59, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 1.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 60, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 61, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "74_g8_shipatelier", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 62, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 63, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 1.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 64, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 65, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2274_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 66, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2275_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 67, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "还有两个小时。起重机那边已经一切就位了，你的船检查得怎么样了？", "name": "干练的船工"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2275_1#1$1"}, {"id": 68, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 69, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "没有问题！像斐戴拉大审判官嘱咐的那样，要是起重机出了故障，随时有船可以出海检修设备！", "name": "热情的船工"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2274_1#1$1"}, {"id": 70, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 71, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "那就再测试一遍通讯稳定性，一旦我们给出信号，打捞中心的操作员就会启动程序，正式开始打捞了。", "name": "干练的船工"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2275_1#1$1"}, {"id": 72, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 73, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "明白！等等，我们还没有获得通讯系统的授权？", "name": "热情的船工"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2274_1#1$1"}, {"id": 74, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 75, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "权限应该在半小时前就开通了啊？去找找斐戴拉大审判官！", "name": "干练的船工"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2275_1#1$1"}, {"id": 76, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 77, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 78, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 79, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 80, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 81, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 82, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "27_g25_goldenboat_core", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 83, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 1.5, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 84, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 85, "prop": "playMusic", "attributes": {"intro": "$farce_intro", "key": "$farce_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 86, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_393_toledo_1#1$1", "posfrom": "-120,0", "posto": "100,0", "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 87, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 88, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_393_toledo_1#11$1"}}, {"id": 89, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我们进来了，我们就这么进来了？这可是整个港都的中控室啊！", "name": "特菲"}, "figure_art": "avg_393_toledo_1#11$1"}, {"id": 90, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 91, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "posfrom": "100,0", "posto": "-100,0", "afrom": 1.0, "ato": 1.0, "duration": 1.2}}, {"id": 92, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.5}}, {"id": 93, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_393_toledo_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 94, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "这地上、墙上，不会真的都是金子吧？这么大的炉子，是港都的动力源？快过来看，还有这个……", "name": "特菲"}, "figure_art": "avg_393_toledo_1#1$1"}, {"id": 95, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 96, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "posfrom": "-100,0", "posto": "0,0", "afrom": 1.0, "ato": 1.0, "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 97, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 98, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_393_toledo_1#2$1"}}, {"id": 99, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "瓦列里奥，你光盯着那个黑乎乎的大铁匣子看什么？", "name": "特菲"}, "figure_art": "avg_393_toledo_1#2$1"}, {"id": 100, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2266_1#4$1"}}, {"id": 101, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "导航、动力、通讯——港都作为移动城市的几乎所有功能，都是这个大铁匣子里的东西在维系着。", "name": "瓦列里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2266_1#4$1"}, {"id": 102, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_393_toledo_1#15$1"}}, {"id": 103, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "那里面好像有什么东西在动——", "name": "特菲"}, "figure_art": "avg_393_toledo_1#15$1"}, {"id": 104, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2266_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 105, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "可别碰它，斐戴拉大审判官会怪罪我们的。", "name": "瓦列里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2266_1#1$1"}, {"id": 106, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_393_toledo_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 107, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "这些都是那个大审判官告诉你的吗？你向她保证了什么，她才同意让我们进来啊？", "name": "特菲"}, "figure_art": "avg_393_toledo_1#1$1"}, {"id": 108, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_393_toledo_1#7$1"}}, {"id": 109, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "她之前拒绝我，可是毫不留情啊！", "name": "特菲"}, "figure_art": "avg_393_toledo_1#7$1"}, {"id": 110, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 111, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2266_1#2$1"}}, {"id": 112, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "斐戴拉大审判官需要坚守自己的职责，让她启动海图系统，是卡门阁下的直接命令。", "name": "瓦列里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2266_1#2$1"}, {"id": 113, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_393_toledo_1#10$1"}}, {"id": 114, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "那你这次又是怎么搞定的，快给我讲讲！我嘴皮子都磨破了，她就像没听见似的！", "name": "特菲"}, "figure_art": "avg_393_toledo_1#10$1"}, {"id": 115, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 116, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$flashback", "volume": 0.8}}, {"id": 117, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 255.0, "g": 255.0, "b": 255.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 118, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 255.0, "g": 255.0, "b": 255.0, "fadetime": 0.5, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 119, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 120, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "74_g8_shipatelier", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 121, "prop": "CameraEffect", "attributes": {"effect": "Grayscale", "amount": 0.8, "keep": "true"}}, {"id": 122, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.5, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 123, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.5}}, {"id": 124, "prop": "playMusic", "attributes": {"intro": "$darkness02_intro", "key": "$darkness02_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 125, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2270_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 126, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你们回去巡逻吧，切记，不能让任何闲杂人等靠近中控室，那是整个港都的心脏。", "name": "斐戴拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2270_1#1$1"}, {"id": 127, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 128, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 129, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2276_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 130, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2276_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 131, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "是！", "name": "惩戒军士兵"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2276_1#1$1"}, {"id": 132, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 133, "prop": "playsound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_gen_soldiersrun"}}, {"id": 134, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "afrom": 1.0, "ato": 0.0, "duration": 1.5}}, {"id": 135, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "afrom": 1.0, "ato": 0.0, "duration": 1.5}}, {"id": 136, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 137, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 138, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.5}}, {"id": 139, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2270_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 140, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "点亮海图……她根本不知道那个光点意味着什么，更不知道审判庭要付出什么，就连我也……", "name": "斐戴拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2270_1#1$1"}, {"id": 141, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 142, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "focus": "n"}}, {"id": 143, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_woodfloor_fts", "volume": 1.0}}, {"id": 144, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 145, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 146, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "谁在那里！", "name": "斐戴拉"}}, {"id": 147, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 148, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 149, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2266_1#1$1", "duration": 0.8}}, {"id": 150, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 151, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "抱歉，大审判官阁下，是我。", "name": "瓦列里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2266_1#1$1"}, {"id": 152, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2270_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 153, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不用说了。", "name": "斐戴拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2270_1#1$1"}, {"id": 154, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "从我们认识到现在不过一两周，你替埃斯特菲尼娅求情多少次了？我应当辞退她，还你我一个清净。", "name": "斐戴拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2270_1#1$1"}, {"id": 155, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2266_1#11$1"}}, {"id": 156, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我明白，您也听厌了我讲她的事。所以，我这次来，是想跟您讲讲我自己。", "name": "瓦列里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2266_1#11$1"}, {"id": 157, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2270_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 158, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你？", "name": "斐戴拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2270_1#1$1"}, {"id": 159, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2266_1#9$1"}}, {"id": 160, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "在遇到特菲之前，我也在伊比利亚的各处流浪。我身上的伤是为救一个朋友留下的，在咸涩的海风里，它迟迟没有愈合。", "name": "瓦列里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2266_1#9$1"}, {"id": 161, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2266_1#5$1"}}, {"id": 162, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "疼痛让我无法入眠，每个宵禁的夜晚，我只能思考，思考我为何沦落到这个地步，思考伊比利亚的一切。", "name": "瓦列里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2266_1#5$1"}, {"id": 163, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2266_1#4$1"}}, {"id": 164, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "直到我在酒馆里遇到这个唱船歌的黎博利，我一眼就能看出她靠欺骗为生，但她用自己的钱给我买了食物。", "name": "瓦列里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2266_1#4$1"}, {"id": 165, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2266_1#4$1"}}, {"id": 166, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "之后，我与她一起流浪，她用那套贵族的说辞骗了很多人，也救下了很多人。", "name": "瓦列里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2266_1#4$1"}, {"id": 167, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2266_1#12$1"}}, {"id": 168, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "她好像真的把自己当作了黄金时代的贵族，她想保护所有拥护者，甚至实现他们的愿望——包括我的，所以我们才来到这里。", "name": "瓦列里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2266_1#12$1"}, {"id": 169, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2266_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 170, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "而这次，她向你提出不知天高地厚的要求，也只是为了再救一个人。", "name": "瓦列里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2266_1#1$1"}, {"id": 171, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2270_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 172, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "斐戴拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2270_1#1$1"}, {"id": 173, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 174, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$flashback", "volume": 0.8}}, {"id": 175, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 255.0, "g": 255.0, "b": 255.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 176, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 255.0, "g": 255.0, "b": 255.0, "fadetime": 0.5, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 177, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 178, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "27_g25_goldenboat_core", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 179, "prop": "CameraEffect", "attributes": {"effect": "Grayscale", "amount": 0.0, "keep": "true"}}, {"id": 180, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.5, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 181, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 182, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_393_toledo_1#4$1"}}, {"id": 183, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……怪不得她能让你也跟我一起进来。你看，虽然死板得要命，但真诚的故事和经历还是可以打动她的。", "name": "特菲"}, "figure_art": "avg_393_toledo_1#4$1"}, {"id": 184, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_393_toledo_1#5$1"}}, {"id": 185, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "要我说，我们这回点亮了坐标，真成了像样的“大人物”之后，就该去出书立传，给所有人讲故事。我口述，你写。", "name": "特菲"}, "figure_art": "avg_393_toledo_1#5$1"}, {"id": 186, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2266_1#4$1"}}, {"id": 187, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "瓦列里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2266_1#4$1"}, {"id": 188, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_393_toledo_1#15$1"}}, {"id": 189, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "怎么啦？你怎么不说话了？我还想知道是你的哪段经历那么感人，能打动那位石头似的大审判官呢。", "name": "特菲"}, "figure_art": "avg_393_toledo_1#15$1"}, {"id": 190, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2266_1#4$1"}}, {"id": 191, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我还有哪段经历，是你不知道的呢？", "name": "瓦列里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2266_1#4$1"}, {"id": 192, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2266_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 193, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "既然大审判官阁下把这份重任交到了我们手上，我们就绝不能耽搁一秒。故事，就等回去再讲吧？", "name": "瓦列里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2266_1#1$1"}, {"id": 194, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_393_toledo_1#10$1"}}, {"id": 195, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "喔喔，那当然好！", "name": "特菲"}, "figure_art": "avg_393_toledo_1#10$1"}, {"id": 196, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_393_toledo_1#13$1"}}, {"id": 197, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不过，我们是不是应该向斐戴拉大审判官确认一下操作流程？点亮海图这事儿还是太大了……", "name": "特菲"}, "figure_art": "avg_393_toledo_1#13$1"}, {"id": 198, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2266_1#4$1"}}, {"id": 199, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不用担心，很快斐戴拉大审判官就会来的。", "name": "瓦列里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2266_1#4$1"}, {"id": 200, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2266_1#4$1"}}, {"id": 201, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "继续吧，只要能恢复海图系统的功能，一切都会如你所愿的。", "name": "瓦列里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2266_1#4$1"}, {"id": 202, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 203, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 204, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 205, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 206, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 207, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "74_g4_seasidest_n", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 208, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 209, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 210, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 211, "prop": "playMusic", "attributes": {"intro": "$m_bat_act17side_02_intro", "key": "$m_bat_act17side_02_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 212, "prop": "CameraShake", "attributes": {"duration": 4.0, "xstrength": 30.0, "ystrength": 30.0, "vibrato": 30.0, "randomness": 90.0, "fadeout": "true", "block": "false"}}, {"id": 213, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_gen_soldiersrun", "volume": 1.0}}, {"id": 214, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2276_1#1$1", "duration": 0.4, "isblock": "true"}}, {"id": 215, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "afrom": 1.0, "ato": 0.0, "duration": 0.4, "isblock": "true"}}, {"id": 216, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2276_1#1$1", "duration": 0.4, "isblock": "true"}}, {"id": 217, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "afrom": 1.0, "ato": 0.0, "duration": 0.4, "isblock": "true"}}, {"id": 218, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2276_1#1$1", "duration": 0.4, "isblock": "true"}}, {"id": 219, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "afrom": 1.0, "ato": 0.0, "duration": 0.4, "isblock": "true"}}, {"id": 220, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2276_1#1$1", "duration": 0.4, "isblock": "true"}}, {"id": 221, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "afrom": 1.0, "ato": 0.0, "duration": 0.4, "isblock": "true"}}, {"id": 222, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 223, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 224, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_gen_walk_n", "volume": 1.0}}, {"id": 225, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2277_1#1$1", "duration": 1.5, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 226, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.8}}, {"id": 227, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "自首的那个岛民没说假话，这三天我们已经确认了袭击案嫌犯的据点。为了避免惊扰敌人，暂时还没有实施任何抓捕行动。", "name": "惩戒军士官"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2276_1#1$1"}, {"id": 228, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "那些人多是伤员，士气低落，但他们的组织者非常谨慎，直到今早才露面。也是因此，我们才能确认据点的位置无误。", "name": "惩戒军士官"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2276_1#1$1"}, {"id": 229, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "今晚，港都中心城区会回归伊比利亚的海岸线，而那些阴魂不散的邪教徒，也会受到审判。", "name": "惩戒军士官"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2276_1#1$1"}, {"id": 230, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "艾丽妮，圣徒阁下还有什么指示吗？", "name": "惩戒军士官"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2276_1#1$1"}, {"id": 231, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4009_irene_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 232, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "卡门阁下不会亲自参与抓捕，但他给出了明确的指示——", "name": "艾丽妮"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2276_1#1$1"}, {"id": 233, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4009_irene_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 234, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "如果敌人已是深渊的俘虏，他们的尸骨甚至不配被扔进大海；但若他们只是迷茫的同胞，就用灯火指引他们上岸。", "name": "艾丽妮"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2276_1#1$1"}, {"id": 235, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4009_irene_1#4$1"}}, {"id": 236, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "列队！出发！", "name": "艾丽妮"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2276_1#1$1"}, {"id": 237, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 238, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 239, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 240, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_gen_soldiersrun", "volume": 1.0}}, {"id": 241, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2276_1#1$1", "posfrom": "0,0", "posto": "120,0", "afrom": 1.0, "ato": 0.0, "duration": 1.5}}, {"id": 242, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2276_1#1$1", "posfrom": "0,0", "posto": "120,0", "afrom": 1.0, "ato": 0.0, "duration": 1.5}}, {"id": 243, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.8}}, {"id": 244, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2267_1#1$1", "posfrom": "-120,0", "posto": "30,0", "duration": 1.5}}, {"id": 245, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.2}}, {"id": 246, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2269_1#1$1", "posfrom": "50,0", "posto": "0,0", "afrom": 0.0, "ato": 1.0, "duration": 0.5}}, {"id": 247, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 0.5}}, {"id": 248, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2269_1#6$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 249, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "教官！", "name": "南多"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2269_1#6$1"}, {"id": 250, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2267_1#8$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 251, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我把耳朵塞好了，你说吧。", "name": "德鲁莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2267_1#8$1"}, {"id": 252, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2269_1#6$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 253, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "您才休养了几天？伤口都还在渗血！", "name": "南多"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2269_1#6$1"}, {"id": 254, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2267_1#9$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 255, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "要我躺在自己乱七八糟、气味难闻的屋子里，看着你们从窗口经过，去抓我查了这么久的幕后黑手——", "name": "德鲁莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2267_1#9$1"}, {"id": 256, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2267_1#9$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 257, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我伤口就要气裂了。", "name": "德鲁莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2267_1#9$1"}, {"id": 258, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2269_1#11$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 259, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "您在说谎，教官。", "name": "南多"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2269_1#11$1"}, {"id": 260, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2269_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 261, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "如果您在完全能合理偷懒的情况下选择行动，那就意味着您觉得这次任务一定有问题。", "name": "南多"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2269_1#1$1"}, {"id": 262, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2267_1#7$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 263, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "呵，难得机灵。", "name": "德鲁莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2267_1#7$1"}, {"id": 264, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2269_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 265, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "事情……这么严重？", "name": "南多"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2269_1#1$1"}, {"id": 266, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2267_1#9$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 267, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我没证据，你就先当是一个失血过多的伤员在胡言乱语吧。", "name": "德鲁莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2267_1#9$1"}, {"id": 268, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2267_1#3$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 269, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不论那位主教能变出多少只恐鱼，他都只有一张嘴能用来指挥人。对于一个要躲在暗处的人来说，那张嘴还不太方便说话。", "name": "德鲁莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2267_1#3$1"}, {"id": 270, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2267_1#9$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 271, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我不相信他仅凭自己就能那么手眼通天，指挥那些邪教徒和岛民完成那样精准的袭击计划。", "name": "德鲁莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2267_1#9$1"}, {"id": 272, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2269_1#4$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 273, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "您怀疑他还有帮手？", "name": "南多"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2269_1#4$1"}, {"id": 274, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2267_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 275, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "希望是我想多了。", "name": "德鲁莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2267_1#1$1"}, {"id": 276, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2267_1#9$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 277, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "保护好自己，别死在伊比利亚几十年难遇的大日子里。", "name": "德鲁莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2267_1#9$1"}, {"id": 278, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 279, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 280, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 281, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 282, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 283, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "32_RL2_cliffnight", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 284, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 285, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_sea", "volume": 0.0, "channel": "f", "loop": "true"}}, {"id": 286, "prop": "SoundVolume", "attributes": {"volume": 1.0, "channel": "f", "fadetime": 1.0}}, {"id": 287, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 288, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 289, "prop": "playMusic", "attributes": {"intro": "$chenandwei_intro", "key": "$chenandwei_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 290, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_gen_walk_n", "volume": 1.0}}, {"id": 291, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4232_hbound_1#1$1", "duration": 1.5, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 292, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 293, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4232_hbound_1#4$1"}}, {"id": 294, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "克莱门莎监事？您应该在广场参加迎回雷亚-伊比利亚的庆典，怎么在这儿……", "name": "纳乔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4232_hbound_1#4$1"}, {"id": 295, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#4$1"}}, {"id": 296, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "奥卢斯的计划很有可能还在继续，为了避免横生事端，惩戒军今晚就会开始抓捕行动。", "name": "克莱门莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#4$1"}, {"id": 297, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4232_hbound_1#4$1"}}, {"id": 298, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "今晚？那我的同胞们——", "name": "纳乔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4232_hbound_1#4$1"}, {"id": 299, "prop": "StopSound", "attributes": {"channel": "f", "fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 300, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#4$1"}}, {"id": 301, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我已经与伊比利亚阁下达成了些许共识。所有岛民都有机会离开这里，去往阿戈尔生活。", "name": "克莱门莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#4$1"}, {"id": 302, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#11$1"}}, {"id": 303, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "但不是现在。", "name": "克莱门莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#11$1"}, {"id": 304, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#11$1"}}, {"id": 305, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "阿戈尔有权迁移同胞，但无权干涉今晚的抓捕行动。", "name": "克莱门莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#11$1"}, {"id": 306, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#2$1"}}, {"id": 307, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "如果这场抓捕和后续的审判因我的干涉而生变，我不确定伊比利亚会不会发生更大的动乱。", "name": "克莱门莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#2$1"}, {"id": 308, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#4$1"}}, {"id": 309, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你的同胞被逮捕之后还需在审判庭度过一段日子，不过，你可以在弥利亚留姆等你的朋友们受审结束。", "name": "克莱门莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#4$1"}, {"id": 310, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4232_hbound_1#9$1"}}, {"id": 311, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……在弥利亚留姆？", "name": "纳乔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4232_hbound_1#9$1"}, {"id": 312, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_sea", "volume": 0.0, "channel": "f", "loop": "true"}}, {"id": 313, "prop": "SoundVolume", "attributes": {"volume": 1.0, "channel": "f", "fadetime": 1.0}}, {"id": 314, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#5$1"}}, {"id": 315, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你从来没有直接造成过任何破坏和伤亡，参与袭击也只是被迫卷入其中。况且，你的证言也准确有效。", "name": "克莱门莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#5$1"}, {"id": 316, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#4$1"}}, {"id": 317, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我与伊比利亚阁下商议的结果是，你可以成为第一个迁回阿戈尔的岛民。", "name": "克莱门莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#4$1"}, {"id": 318, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4232_hbound_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 319, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……我跟您说过吗，克莱门莎监事？", "name": "纳乔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4232_hbound_1#1$1"}, {"id": 320, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4232_hbound_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 321, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "截肢之后，我很痛苦也很沮丧。理智告诉我邻居的报复情有可原，感性又阻拦我对奶奶宣泄情绪。", "name": "纳乔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4232_hbound_1#1$1"}, {"id": 322, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4232_hbound_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 323, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "所以我做了一件在阿奎拉他们看来很蠢的事——我试图融入伊比利亚人，向他们证明岛民也可以和伊比利亚人好好相处。", "name": "纳乔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4232_hbound_1#1$1"}, {"id": 324, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4232_hbound_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 325, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我能背诵每一部经书，也从未缺席过一场礼拜，哪怕我认得出向我家窗户扔燃烧瓶的邻居是哪几个，我也会对他们微笑。", "name": "纳乔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4232_hbound_1#1$1"}, {"id": 326, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4232_hbound_1#3$1"}}, {"id": 327, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "直到有一天我被镇上的证裁官喊去担任辅祭——", "name": "纳乔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4232_hbound_1#3$1"}, {"id": 328, "prop": "StopSound", "attributes": {"channel": "f", "fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 329, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#15$1"}}, {"id": 330, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "据我的了解，这样的举动几乎可以代表伊比利亚对你的认可。", "name": "克莱门莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#15$1"}, {"id": 331, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4232_hbound_1#2$1"}}, {"id": 332, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "是啊，我高兴得几乎要哭出来。", "name": "纳乔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4232_hbound_1#2$1"}, {"id": 333, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4232_hbound_1#7$1"}}, {"id": 334, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "但我很快就发现，我感到欣喜，不是因为辅祭是多了不得的差事，只是因为大多岛民这辈子都无法获得这份“认可”，仅此而已。", "name": "纳乔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4232_hbound_1#7$1"}, {"id": 335, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4232_hbound_1#5$1"}}, {"id": 336, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我为自己的欣喜感到羞耻。", "name": "纳乔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4232_hbound_1#5$1"}, {"id": 337, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#4$1"}}, {"id": 338, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "追求更好的生活并不可耻。", "name": "克莱门莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#4$1"}, {"id": 339, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4232_hbound_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 340, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我明白，但我无法回到阿戈尔这件事已成定局。", "name": "纳乔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4232_hbound_1#1$1"}, {"id": 341, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_sea", "volume": 0.0, "channel": "f", "loop": "true"}}, {"id": 342, "prop": "SoundVolume", "attributes": {"volume": 1.0, "channel": "f", "fadetime": 1.0}}, {"id": 343, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 344, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 345, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "纳乔抬起自己的右手，黄金时代工匠的手笔，包括失而复得的那枚螺栓，浑然一体，流畅地运转着。"}}, {"id": 346, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "但透明的外壳下，独属于海嗣的触肢在隐蔽的角落里跳动着，是它们维持着假肢的稳定，缓解使用者的痛苦。"}}, {"id": 347, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4232_hbound_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 348, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我接受了奥卢斯先生的手术。如果不是那场手术，我没法从袭击现场救回那么多同胞，我不后悔。", "name": "纳乔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4232_hbound_1#1$1"}, {"id": 349, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#11$1"}}, {"id": 350, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "纳乔……", "name": "克莱门莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#11$1"}, {"id": 351, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#4$1"}}, {"id": 352, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我明白了。我撤回提前将你迁回阿戈尔的提议。", "name": "克莱门莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#4$1"}, {"id": 353, "prop": "StopSound", "attributes": {"channel": "f", "fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 354, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#4$1"}}, {"id": 355, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "但不是因为你接受了那场手术，而是出于你接受它的那个原因。", "name": "克莱门莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#4$1"}, {"id": 356, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#5$1"}}, {"id": 357, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "既然你接受手术，本就是为了能救回更多岛民，那我想，你今晚一定也会需要做同样的事。", "name": "克莱门莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#5$1"}, {"id": 358, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4232_hbound_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 359, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "嗯。虽然有您担保，但既然是抓捕行动，今晚一定还会有人反抗，会有人受伤。", "name": "纳乔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4232_hbound_1#1$1"}, {"id": 360, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4232_hbound_1#2$1"}}, {"id": 361, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我得在场，我得帮忙。", "name": "纳乔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4232_hbound_1#2$1"}, {"id": 362, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#4$1"}}, {"id": 363, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "那我会竭力保障你自由行动的权利，今晚，没有人能因那些海嗣触肢给你定罪。", "name": "克莱门莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#4$1"}, {"id": 364, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#4$1"}}, {"id": 365, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "而等到你真正被海嗣同化的那一刻，我也一定会亲手给你解脱。", "name": "克莱门莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#4$1"}, {"id": 366, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 367, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 368, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 369, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 370, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 371, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 372, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 373, "prop": "Image", "attributes": {}}], "OPTIONTRACE": true}